# 14. PRIVACY AND SECURITY REQUIREMENTS

Treat privacy as a core product feature.

- Process all analysis locally in the browser.
- Never upload user input.
- Never use a remote AI API.
- Never log pasted HTML or field values to the console.
- Never persist pasted form content in localStorage, sessionStorage, URLs, or browser history.
